  section('slideshow-presets','Presets, memories & presentations','<div class="library-fields"><div><label for="slideshow-preset-name">Save current slideshow as</label><input id="slideshow-preset-name" maxlength="60"></div><div><label for="slideshow-preset">Saved presets</label><select id="slideshow-preset"></select></div></div><div class="library-actions"><button id="slideshow-save-preset" class="secondary" type="button">Save preset</button><button id="slideshow-load-preset" class="quiet" type="button">Load preset</button><button id="slideshow-delete-preset" class="quiet" type="button">Delete preset</button></div><label class="cal-check"><input id="slideshow-seasonal" type="checkbox"> This preset is seasonal</label><div class="library-fields"><div><label for="slideshow-season-start">From month</label><input id="slideshow-season-start" type="number" min="1" max="12"></div><div><label for="slideshow-season-end">Through month</label><input id="slideshow-season-end" type="number" min="1" max="12"></div></div><p class="small subtle">On this day uses capture dates from earlier years. Seasonal presets can span December into January. An empty or out-of-season collection does not expose another collection automatically.</p><details class="library-advanced"><summary>Presentation title & video export</summary><label class="cal-check"><input id="slideshow-story" type="checkbox"> Show presentation title cards</label><label for="slideshow-story-title">Title</label><input id="slideshow-story-title" maxlength="100"><label for="slideshow-story-outro">Closing title · optional</label><input id="slideshow-story-outro" maxlength="100"><label for="slideshow-title-seconds">Seconds per title card</label><input id="slideshow-title-seconds" type="number" min="2" max="10"><p class="small subtle">Only deliberately titled presentations show this text. Everyday slideshows remain free of captions and titles.</p><label for="slideshow-export-seconds">Seconds per exported slide</label><input id="slideshow-export-seconds" type="number" min="2" max="10" value="5"><div class="library-actions"><button id="slideshow-export" class="secondary" type="button">Export selected pictures as video</button><button id="slideshow-export-cancel" class="quiet" type="button" hidden>Cancel export</button></div><p id="slideshow-export-status" class="small" role="status"></p><video id="slideshow-export-preview" class="library-media-preview" controls hidden></video><p class="small subtle">A bounded WebM presentation: up to 12 selected still pictures and 120 seconds, saved to Downloads on the frame. Nothing is uploaded. Export support is checked on this browser.</p></details>');
  section('slideshow-phone','Phone curation · local Wi-Fi','<p class="small subtle">Start a 15-minute encrypted session on this frame, then open its local address on a phone on the same Wi-Fi. Verify the certificate fingerprint against this screen before approving the local certificate warning. Enter the one-time six-digit code on the phone. No cloud account, router forwarding or debugging access is involved.</p><div class="library-actions"><button id="slideshow-phone-start" class="secondary" type="button">Start phone session</button><button id="slideshow-phone-stop" class="quiet" type="button">Stop session</button></div><div id="slideshow-phone-status" class="library-phone-status" role="status"></div><p class="small subtle">The service is off by default, does not restart with Android, and closes automatically. Stopping it immediately revokes access. Account credentials and calendar feeds are never part of this interface.</p>');
